{"clauses": ["amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:transport/section:performatives/type:begin/field:handle-max.2"], "kind": "exchange", "note": "the partner's begin announces handle-max 2 and we attach at 3 — one above the bound, where a bound widened by one shows; the corpus's range vector attaches at 5, which a runaway bound and a widened one refuse alike, so it cannot tell the two apart", "start": "session:UNMAPPED", "steps": [{"direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "session:BEGIN_SENT", "status": "admitted"}, "value": {"body": [{"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 17}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [{"type": "null"}, {"type": "uint", "value": 0}, {"type": "uint", "value": 16}, {"type": "uint", "value": 16}], "type": "list"}}], "channel": 1, "doff": 2, "payload": "", "type": "00"}}, {"bytes": "0000002502000001005311c018056000017000000000700000001070000000107000000002", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "session:MAPPED", "status": "admitted"}}, {"direction": "send", "expect": {"condition": "amqp:connection:framing-error", "reason": "limit", "state": "connection:CLOSE_SENT", "status": "refused"}, "value": {"body": [{"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 18}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [{"text": "probe", "type": "string"}, {"type": "uint", "value": 3}, {"type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"type": "null"}, {"type": "null"}, {"type": "null"}, {"type": "null"}, {"type": "null"}, {"type": "null"}, {"type": "uint", "value": 0}], "type": "list"}}], "channel": 1, "doff": 2, "payload": "", "type": "00"}}], "vector": "exchange-link-handle-at-bound-plus-one"}
